      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING MAVERICK (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 16.63 beating He's Talking. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Can measure up again. RIPPED PAIGE (3) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at Shepparton in a handy 25.67 beating Romani Road. Deserves serious consideration again. DARING BANDIT (6) has a strong record this trip with six wins and two placings from 15 starts. Was out of placings last time (19.51) at this track in a Free For All, finishing sixth and beaten 6 lengths. Can feature in the finish. MORNING (2) deserves plenty of thought over this distance.",
